---
/** The three kinds of answer the widget gives, using its shipped labels. */
---

<section class="answers" aria-labelledby="answers-title">
  <div class="wrap ruled">
    <div class="answers__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Honest answers</p>
      <h2 id="answers-title" class="h2">It tells shoppers when it’s close.</h2>
      <p class="body-l">
        Every answer shows how sure Snug is and why. When a shopper sits between two sizes, Snug says so, and they pick the fit they like.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="cards" role="list">
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="card__k mono-s">01 · A clear answer</h3>
        <div class="card__ui">
          <span class="ui__lbl">Recommended Size for You</span>
          <span class="ui__big">XL</span>
          <span class="ui__conf">Match confidence <b class="pill pill--high">High</b></span>
          <span class="ui__why">Your regular fit L gives an estimated body chest of 106.3 cm. XL is the closest match.</span>
        </div>
        <p class="card__b">One size, how sure Snug is, and the reason in plain words.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="card__k mono-s">02 · Between two sizes</h3>
        <div class="card__ui">
          <span class="ui__lbl">You sit right between two sizes!</span>
          <span class="ui__sub">Choose your preferred fit style:</span>
          <div class="ui__pair">
            <span class="ui__opt"><b>M</b>Snug Fit</span>
            <span class="ui__opt ui__opt--on"><b>L</b>Relaxed Fit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="card__b">Near a boundary, the shopper chooses snugger or roomier instead of guessing.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <h3 class="card__k mono-s">03 · Two sizes could work</h3>
        <div class="card__ui">
          <span class="ui__lbl">Two sizes could work for you</span>
          <div class="ui__pair">
            <span class="ui__opt"><b>S</b>Fitted<small>Closest to the garment you own</small></span>
            <span class="ui__opt ui__opt--on"><b>L</b>Full Silhouette<small>The cut this brand intends</small></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="card__b">When your fit differs from theirs, for example oversized, they see both options.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
